        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a local move from Bandhidih to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For a Bandhidih to Mumbai relocation you’ll need a valid ID proof, address proof, GST‑registered invoice (if applicable), e‑Way bill, and the IBA‑approved mover code certificate. These documents ensure smooth customs clearance, accurate billing, and eligibility for government or corporate reimbursement.</p>
