        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shifting charges are based on the volume of goods, distance (≈1499 km via NH 19), type of packaging, and any special handling like fragile items or car transport. Our transparent tariff breakdown includes labor, fuel surcharge, insurance, and GST, giving you a low‑cost, no‑hidden‑fees quote.</p>
