        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for moving my furniture across states?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we provide 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance for every shipment. This covers loss or damage during the entire journey from Bandhidih to Mumbai, giving you peace of mind while complying with IBA and ISO‑9001 standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike or car while it is being shipped?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our GPS‑enclosed container fleet offers live tracking through a secure portal. You receive real‑time location updates, temperature monitoring, and estimated arrival times, ensuring complete visibility for bike, scooter, or car shifting charges.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 4‑protocol zero‑damage system work for delicate items?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system starts with a pre‑move inspection, followed by custom wooden crates and 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging. Anti‑shock padding and secure lashings protect items during transit, and a post‑move audit confirms condition. This protocol eliminates damage risk for fragile household and commercial goods.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer GST‑compliant billing for corporate relocations?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every invoice is GST‑compliant, includes the mover’s GSTIN, and is compatible with corporate expense policies. Our IBA‑approved billing format also features e‑Way bill numbers, making it easy for businesses to claim reimbursements and maintain audit trails.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical timeline for a Bandhidih to Mumbai relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard household move from Bandhidih to Mumbai takes 4‑5 days: 1 day for packing, 2‑3 days for transit via NH 19, and 1 day for unloading and placement. Timelines may vary based on volume, weather, and any additional services like carpentry or assembly.</p>
